    "body": "Per \"element is a shadow host and the result of retargeting its node document’s fullscreen element against element is element\" in https://fullscreen.spec.whatwg.org/#:fullscreen-pseudo-class both the video element and the my-web-component element should match the :fullscreen pseudo class.\r\n\r\nHowever, this isn't implemented in Chromium. Which behavior are you actually seeing?",
